        "QuestionText": "<audio controls preload=\"none\" style=\"width:100%\"><source src=\"https://qualtrics.ucl.ac.uk/CP/File.php?F=F_i1ePOaTPe70eq5b\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio><br><br><b>How well do these two segments fit together?</b><br>The second segment is the same passage of music again, sometimes altered. Listen for anything that changes between them &mdash; the key, the tempo, the instruments, the tone or recording quality.",
