      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<b>Version A</b><br>${lm://Field/2}<br><br><b>Version B</b><br>${lm://Field/3}<br><br><b>Which version's regenerated section fits better with the surrounding music?</b><br>Both versions share the same surrounding music &mdash; only the middle section differs. Judge how well that middle section matches the rest, for example in key, style, tempo and instrumentation.",
